---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import { testimonials } from "../data/testimonials";
---

<Layout
  title="Sawatzky Development | Developer & Technical Consultant"
  description="Independent developer and consultant. Advice, custom tools, and rapid lightweight websites for small teams and owner-run businesses."
>
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 pb-8 pt-8 sm:px-6 sm:pt-10 lg:px-8">
    <div class="hero-panel relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-14 lg:px-12 lg:py-16">
      <div class="relative max-w-3xl">
        <p class="tag-accent animate-fade-in-up">Developer & consultant</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-1 mt-5 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Bring the problem. We’ll find the right kind of help.
        </h1>
        <p class="animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-2 mt-6 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
          I advise and build for small teams and owner-run businesses. That might be a second opinion, a custom tool, or a fast website. If you are not sure which one you need, that is a fine place to start.
        </p>
        <div class="animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-3 mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#" data-contact-open class="btn-primary">
            Start a conversation
            <Icon name="arrow" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
          <a href="#help" class="btn-ghost">
            See how I can help
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="help" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="kicker">How I can help</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Ways to work together</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          There is no single package for every project. These are the shapes the work usually takes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="tech-card tech-card-cyan">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-cyan-400/15 text-cyan-700">
              <Icon name="compass" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan-700">01</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">Consulting</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            A clear outside view when a project is stuck, getting expensive, or still just an idea. Useful before more time or money goes into the wrong thing.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="tech-card tech-card-indigo">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600">
              <Icon name="code" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-indigo-600">02</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">Custom tools</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Tools built around how your business actually works, including the pieces that connect what you already use.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="tech-card tech-card-amber">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-400/15 text-amber-700">
              <Icon name="globe" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-amber-700">03</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">Rapid websites</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            A fast, well-designed site that looks right on a phone and is easy to keep up to date.
          </p>
          <a href="/websites" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-700 hover:text-cyan-600">
            Rapid, lightweight websites
            <Icon name="arrow" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {
    testimonials.length > 0 && (
      <section>
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
          <p class="kicker">Kind words</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif mt-3 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            From people I have worked with
          </h2>
          <div
            class:list={[
              "mt-10 grid gap-4",
              testimonials.length > 1 && "md:grid-cols-2",
              testimonials.length > 2 && "lg:grid-cols-3",
            ]}
          >
            {testimonials.map((item) => (
              <figure class="tech-card tech-card-cyan">
                <blockquote class="font-serif text-xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-950">
                  “{item.quote}”
                </blockquote>
                <figcaption class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-600">
                  <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">{item.name}</span>
                  <span class="mt-0.5 block">{item.detail}</span>
                </figcaption>
              </figure>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    )
  }

  <section id="approach" class="scroll-mt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:px-8">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 p-7 text-slate-300 sm:p-9">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-cyan-300">Getting started</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">A conversation before a commitment.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Tell me what is going on. I’ll say whether I can help, and whether that help is advice, a build, or a smaller first step.
        </p>
        <a href="#" data-contact-open class="btn-primary mt-8">
          Tell me about the project
          <Icon name="arrow" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <ol class="grid gap-3">
        <li class="tech-card tech-card-cyan !p-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan-700">Step 1</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-950">Describe the situation</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">A few sentences is enough. Current tools, what is stuck, and what a good outcome looks like.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="tech-card tech-card-indigo !p-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-indigo-600">Step 2</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-950">Get a direct recommendation</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">I will tell you what I would actually do — including when the honest answer is a smaller project, or that I am the wrong fit.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="tech-card tech-card-amber !p-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-amber-700">Step 3</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-950">Agree on the work</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Advice, something built, or both. A website can also start with a small paid page if you want to see it before committing to the full site.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
